    "text": "The equations of two sides $\\mathrm{AB}$ and $\\mathrm{AC}$ of a triangle $\\mathrm{ABC}$ are $4 x+y=14$ and $3 x-2 y=5$, respectively. The point $\\left(2,-\\frac{4}{3}\\right)$ divides the third side $\\mathrm{BC}$ internally in the ratio $2: 1$. the equation of the side $\\mathrm{BC}$ is",
    "image": null
  },
